    "name": "\uD83C\uDFB6-eurosynth",
    "topic": "**EuroSynth** by Andrew Wingate: a fully digital eurorack synth voice in custom silicon, made on wafer.space Run 2.\n\n**Chip**\n• [EURO](https://wafer.space/ws-run2/projects/EURO.html) (Run 2, 1x0.5 slot)\n**Hear it**\n• [Live playground](https://anfroholic.github.io/eurosynth/web/): the chip's voices in your browser\n**Docs**\n• [Showcase](https://github.com/anfroholic/eurosynth/blob/main/docs/SHOWCASE.md): start here\n• [Hardware guide](https://github.com/anfroholic/eurosynth/blob/main/docs/HARDWARE_GUIDE.md): build a board for it\n**Source**\n• [eurosynth](https://github.com/anfroholic/eurosynth)"
